  (text "POWER: slot +5 V -> MCP1700-3302E/TO (250 mA LDO, TO-92: 1 GND, 2 VIN, 3 VOUT) -> +3V3 (PIC, MCP2562 VIO, 74HC125). The tuner module (VA and VD tied on the breakout) takes +3V3 through a ferrite bead: +3V3A, with 10 uF + 100 nF at its 3.3V pin (the breakout has no supply decoupling of its own). About 40 mA in all." (at 15 100 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1f3eb81a-6be6-5570-8deb-55a8278c9b8d"))
