  (text "PROGRAMMING: J3 is the Microchip 6-pin ICSP header (PICkit 4 / 5, MPLAB Snap): 1 MCLR/VPP, 2 VDD, 3 GND, 4 ICSPDAT, 5 ICSPCLK, 6 not used (LVP). Power the card from the slot; pin 2 lets the programmer sense 3.3 V. J4 debug serial: UART2, 3.3 V logic." (at 15 150 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "c10fa830-490c-5ce1-b178-d4e27d8315db"))
