  (text "CONTROL (2-wire I2C, 100 / 400 kHz): the breakout's 10k pull-ups to its 3.3 V are the only ones (no second pair here). SCLK high at the rising edge of RST selects 2-wire; GPO1 high / GPO2 low at that edge (internal pull-up / pull-down). SEN sets the address (JP1: shunt 1-2 = SEN low = 0x11; 2-3 = 0x63, AN332 6.1). RST has 100k to GND so the tuner waits for the firmware." (at 330 180 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "6140c0a6-98a4-50fa-866b-6a1ce1ff3c3b"))
  (symbol (lib_id "Device:R") (at 340 205 0) (unit 1) (in_bom yes) (on_board yes) (dnp no) (uuid "0bfdd5bb-f703-5762-92d7-44b1e52a3c4a")
