  (text "REFERENCE CLOCK: the tuner takes it from DCLK (the rail BCK, 3.072 MHz at 48 kHz): REFCLK_PRESCALE = 0x1060 (bit 12 RCLKSEL = DCLK, prescale 96), REFCLK_FREQ = 32000 (AN332 properties 0x0201 / 0x0202). So the tuner runs on the audio card's sample clock, and needs no crystal (the breakout has none). Fallback, unfitted: 0 R to RCLK from the rail MCLK (12.288 MHz, prescale 375 = 32768 Hz)." (at 15 295 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7a0c08ef-ccc0-5ecb-99b5-5bebcafb6970"))
  (symbol (lib_id "Device:R") (at 60 320 0) (unit 1) (in_bom yes) (on_board yes) (dnp yes) (uuid "b3529564-ec31-58bf-88d3-180df4d7107d")
