  (text "RAIL (RET, pin 18): audio to the audio card. 74HC125 buffer A, OFF at power-up (OE pulled high; the PIC pulls it low only after a NET RAIL grant, and releases it within 10 ms of a withdrawal), 33 R in series at the pin. Buffers B-D unused: OE high (off), input to GND." (at 130 295 0) (effects (font (size 1.4 1.4)) (justify left top)) (uuid "839c0e90-a668-570e-a9b0-91e2a5764755"))
